        sparse tensor: ``(*batchsize, nrows * blocksize[0], ncols *
        blocksize[1], *densesize)`` where ``blocksize ==
        values.shape[1:3]``. If not provided, the size will be
        inferred as the minimum size big enough to hold all non-zero
        blocks.

